        "original_id": "27295fb4-6061-5913-ab8a-5e6077944d52",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Georgia Middleman, Kenny Loggins, Gary Burr\n- Places: San Antonio, Texas Star Inn\n- Organizations: Blue Sky Riders\n- Products: \"Finally Home\"\n\nFacts:\n- Georgia Middleman sang from age ten at the Texas Star Inn in San Antonio and began writing songs shortly afterward.\n- San Antonio is officially the City of San Antonio, and it is the seventh-most populous city in the United States and the second-most populous city in Texas.\n- Kenny Loggins formed Blue Sky Riders with Gary Burr and Georgia Middleman before releasing \"Finally Home\" in 2013.\n- \"Finally Home\" was released in 2013 shortly after Blue Sky Riders was formed.",
